This is a demo of the NVIDIA BioNeMo to show how it can predict the shape of a protein. 
The fold_demo.py example has a protein sequence. 

python ./fold_demo.py
will run the example on the GPU and output the PDB files in the fold_output directory. 
Please make sure you have write permissions in the current directory where you run this example. 
Open up a web browser and go to https://molstar.org/viewer
Click on Load -> fold_output/T1031_run_01.pdb -> click apply and see the shape of the protein. 

To test the version of BioNeMo used: 
python ./bionemo_version.py
